{"name":"Beauty Bush","hex":"#ebb9b3","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"beauty bush","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Linnaea amabilis, a deciduous flowering shrub in the family Caprifoliaceae."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/beauty_bush"}],"entries":[{"title":"Kolkwitzia","blocks":[{"text":"Kolkwitzia amabilis, commonly known as beauty bush, is a species of flowering plant in the family Caprifoliaceae. It is the sole species in genus Kolkwitzia. It is a deciduous shrub grown as an ornamental plant. In China, where it originated, the plant is called wèi shí shù (蝟实树)."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/33/Kolkwitzia_amabilis4.jpg/330px-Kolkwitzia_amabilis4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kolkwitzia","wikidata":"Q9017870"},{"title":"Beauty","blocks":[{"text":"Beauty is commonly described as a feature of objects that makes them pleasurable to perceive. Such objects include landscapes, sunsets, humans and works of art. Beauty, art and taste are the main subjects of aesthetics, one of the fields of study within philosophy. As a positive aesthetic value, it is contrasted with ugliness as its negative counterpart."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/77/Rozeta_Pary%C5%BC_notre-dame_chalger.jpg/330px-Rozeta_Pary%C5%BC_notre-dame_chalger.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beauty","wikidata":"Q7242"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Kolkwitzia_amabilis5.jpg/500px-Kolkwitzia_amabilis5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/68/Kolkwitzia_amabilis5.jpg/1280px-Kolkwitzia_amabilis5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wi